  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5...18...21 seconds, you cannot be the target of enemy spells, and you gain 5 damage reduction for each Assassin enchantment on you. You cannot deal more than 5...21...25 damage with a single skill or attack.",
      "zhTW": "持續 5～21 秒，你無法成為負面魔法的目標，且身上每一項暗殺加持將使你獲得 5 傷害減免，但是你的單一技能或攻擊不會超過 5～25 傷害。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Elite Enchantment Spell. For 5...13...15 seconds, all hostile spells that target you fail and all attacks against you miss. When Shadow Form ends, lose all but 5...41...50 Health.",
      "zhTW": "持續5～15秒，所有以你為目標的負面魔法將失效，以你為目標的攻擊將失誤。當暗影形態結束時，你將只剩下5～50體力。"
    }
  },
